                <note rend="inline" type="source">815.00/2701: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to
                        the Minister in Honduras</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Morales</hi>)</head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Paraphrase]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1923-10-08T16:00:00-05:00"><hi rendition="#italic">October 8,
                                1923—4 p.m.</hi></date></dateline></opener>
                <p>41. With reference to Legation’s No. 80, October 5, 2 p.m., you will of course
                    not comply with request of the private secretary.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Hughes</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
